# Documate — Clarify before assuming

If the request is ambiguous or could affect **shared** code (`Infrastructure/`, `Domain/` bases, `apps/web` core/shared) or the **wrong module** (Core vs FrontendSupport vs External), **ask** before implementing. Do not silently widen scope.

Full rules: `docs/architecture/governance/prompt-clarification.md`
